  "details": "I noticed very weird behavior when entering a moving VRC Chair in VR.\nWhile sitting in a VRC_Station that is rotating (for example, an animated car or roller coaster), the camera can detach from your true head position relative to the chair in strange and disorienting ways.\nThis seems to be caused by the offset between your head and the center of your VR play space when initially entering the station; when standing exactly at the center of your play space and entering a station, the camera does not sway in the wrong direction as much as if you entered the chair from the corner of a large play space, which it seems to do now.",
